{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.MarkovTransfer","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.MarkovTransfer","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.FreeAlgebra","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.RingQuot"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.markov_transfer_cox","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.markov_transfer_cox","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/MarkovTransfer.lean#L156-L165","doc":"**Torus braids.** The Markov trace of `(s₀ ⋯ s_{n-1})^p` (the `(n+1, p)` torus braid)\nis the same in every Hecke-family algebra, for every Markov trace with the same `z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.lift_cox","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.lift_cox","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/MarkovTransfer.lean#L150-L154","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.cox","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.cox","kind":"def","line":145,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/MarkovTransfer.lean#L145-L148","doc":"The Coxeter element `γ_r = s₀ s₁ ⋯ s_{r-2}` (`cox s n = s₀ ⋯ s_{n-1}`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.markov_transfer","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.markov_transfer","kind":"theorem","line":130,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/MarkovTransfer.lean#L130-L143","doc":"**Markov transfer.** Two normalised, cyclic Markov traces with the same `z`, on two\nalgebras carrying Hecke families with the same `(N, a, b)`, take the same value on the image\nof every element of the presented algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.pullback_markov","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.pullback_markov","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/MarkovTransfer.lean#L117-L126","doc":"A Markov trace on `A` pulls back to a Markov trace on the presented algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.lift_mem_adjoin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.lift_mem_adjoin","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/MarkovTransfer.lean#L107-L115","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.lift_pgen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.lift_pgen","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/MarkovTransfer.lean#L103-L105","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.lift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.lift","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/MarkovTransfer.lean#L88-L101","doc":"The map from the presented algebra to any algebra carrying a Hecke family. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.adjoin_pgen_eq_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.adjoin_pgen_eq_top","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/MarkovTransfer.lean#L80-L83","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.image_pgen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.image_pgen","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/MarkovTransfer.lean#L71-L78","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.pres_heckeFamily","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.pres_heckeFamily","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/MarkovTransfer.lean#L59-L69","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.pgen_of_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.pgen_of_lt","kind":"theorem","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/MarkovTransfer.lean#L55-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.pgen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.pgen","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/IwahoriHecke/MarkovTransfer.lean#L51-L53","doc":"Its generators, ℕ-indexed (`0` from `N` on). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.Pres","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.IwahoriHecke.JonesNormalForm.Pres","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"